    "description": "Themes - This unofficial app is a collection of quality themes for your any smartphones including Xiaomi Mi, Redmi, Samsung Galaxy, Oppo and Realme.\r\n\r\nWhen installing themes, the app redirects you to the <b>Themes Store</b> and from this store you can install for free your chosen themes.\r\n\r\nThe application will regularly add new themes and wallpapers, also notifications about various promotions, will be sent through the application.\r\n\r\n<b>Attention! Some themes may not open in your area due to its inaccessibility in your region.</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Install it now and enjoy your favorite themes and wallpapers.</b>\r\n\r\nJoin us:\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/thegosadesign\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nThis is unofficial theme application, in this application themes from the official Themes Store app are selected to present you with the most creative and high-quality themes for you.",
